      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/fdcpofficial/status/1934612966286204939",
      "text": "READY FOR STORIES THAT CELEBRATE YOU? PELIKULAYA: ENCOUNTERS IS HERE! \n\nThe Film Development Council of the Philippines (FDCP) proudly presents the full film lineup of PELIKULAYA: Encounters — a bold and beautiful celebration of LGBTQ+ stories that connect, empower, and inspire.\n\nThis Pride Month, dive into heartfelt stories, join thought-provoking conversations, and honor  love, identity, and community  in this year’s curation at Pelikulaya.\n\nLet’s celebrate our stories in PELIKULAYA: Encounters!\n\nJUNE 21 to 29, 2025\n- YOUNG HEARTS\n- PORTRAIT OF A LADY ON FIRE\n- PIERCE\n\nJULY 3 to 6, 2025\n- FULL-LENGTH CLASSICS & CONTEMPORARY\n- PELIKULAYA SHORTS\n- EMBASSY SCREENINGS\n\nJULY 12, 2025\n- THE WEDDING BANQUET\n- REBELS OF THE NEON GOD\n- TANGERINE\n\nParticipating cinemas coming soon!\n\n#FDCP #MovieOn #PhilippineCinema #PelikulayaEncounters #PrideMonth",
